即包八平九，通活八路车。这种下法，这种阵容叫作\"三步虎\"。","text":"黑方未跳屏风马即包八平九，通活八路车。这种下法，这种阵容叫作\"三步虎\"。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":6,"anchor_node_id":"0:6","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment7:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment7","raw_text":"红方以不变应万变还是马八进七。","text":"红方以不变应万变还是马八进七。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":7,"anchor_node_id":"0:7","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment8:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment8","raw_text":"如果黑方这个时候跳屏风马。","text":"如果黑方这个时候跳屏风马。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":8,"anchor_node_id":"0:8","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment9:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment9","raw_text":"红方挺进中兵。","text":"红方挺进中兵。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":9,"anchor_node_id":"0:9","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment10:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment10","raw_text":"黑方支士必然。","text":"黑方支士必然。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":10,"anchor_node_id":"0:10","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment11:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment11","raw_text":"红方跃马盘头。","text":"红方跃马盘头。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":11,"anchor_node_id":"0:11","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment12","raw_text":"黑方又飞象固守中防。","text":"黑方又飞象固守中防。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"0:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment13:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment13","raw_text":"红方适时的平车控肋。","text":"红方适时的平车控肋。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":13,"anchor_node_id":"0:13","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment14:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment14","raw_text":"黑方进七路卒，通活七路马。","text":"黑方进七路卒，通活七路马。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":14,"anchor_node_id":"0:14","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment15:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment15","raw_text":"红方再挺中兵。","text":"红方再挺中兵。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":15,"anchor_node_id":"0:15","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment17","raw_text":"黑方进卒去兵时，红方马五进七，这一苹七路马威风凛凛。","text":"黑方进卒去兵时，红方马五进七，这一苹七路马威风凛凛。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"0:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment18","raw_text":"黑方八路车守住卒路线。","text":"黑方八路车守住卒路线。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"0:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment19","raw_text":"红方马七进六，次一著准备卧槽成杀著。","text":"红方马七进六，次一著准备卧槽成杀著。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"0:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment20","raw_text":"黑方退九路包防守必然。","text":"黑方退九路包防守必然。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"0:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment21","raw_text":"红方炮八进四一步定江山，次一著红方跳马卧槽或跳马挂角，都是叫将抽车的棋，局面到此红方优势。","text":"红方炮八进四一步定江山，次一著红方跳马卧槽或跳马挂角，都是叫将抽车的棋，局面到此红方优势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"0:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_8:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_8","raw_text":"我们再回头过来看，当黑方下出\"三步虎\"时，红方的马八进七，我们刚刚介绍黑方跳成屏风马，变化的结果黑方不利。现在我们来看，黑方这一步棋卒三进一，它的变化会怎麽样呢？","text":"我们再回头过来看，当黑方下出\"三步虎\"时，红方的马八进七，我们刚刚介绍黑方跳成屏风马，变化的结果黑方不利。现在我们来看，黑方这一步棋卒三进一，它的变化会怎麽样呢？","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":8,"anchor_node_id":"1:8","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_9:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_9","raw_text":"红方还是中路挺进。","text":"红方还是中路挺进。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":9,"anchor_node_id":"1:9","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_10:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_10","raw_text":"黑方先支士应对。","text":"黑方先支士应对。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":10,"anchor_node_id":"1:10","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_11:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_11","raw_text":"红方平车控肋。","text":"红方平车控肋。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":11,"anchor_node_id":"1:11","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_12:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_12","raw_text":"黑方进车过河。","text":"黑方进车过河。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":12,"anchor_node_id":"1:12","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_13:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_13","raw_text":"红方进车压肋。","text":"红方进车压肋。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":13,"anchor_node_id":"1:13","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_14:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_14","raw_text":"黑方顺势马二进三跳成屏风马。","text":"黑方顺势马二进三跳成屏风马。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":14,"anchor_node_id":"1:14","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_15:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_15","raw_text":"红方续挺中兵。","text":"红方续挺中兵。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":15,"anchor_node_id":"1:15","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_17:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_17","raw_text":"再跃马盘头。","text":"再跃马盘头。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":17,"anchor_node_id":"1:17","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_18:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_18","raw_text":"黑方进卒弃卒。弃卒的目的是让红方这一苹五路暂时出路不畅。","text":"黑方进卒弃卒。弃卒的目的是让红方这一苹五路暂时出路不畅。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":18,"anchor_node_id":"1:18","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_20","raw_text":"黑方也跳马盘头。","text":"黑方也跳马盘头。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"1:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_21:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_21","raw_text":"红方再架当头炮，攻击非常顺利。","text":"红方再架当头炮，攻击非常顺利。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":21,"anchor_node_id":"1:21","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_22:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_22","raw_text":"黑方也反架当头包应对。","text":"黑方也反架当头包应对。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":22,"anchor_node_id":"1:22","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_23:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_23","raw_text":"红方明车是要著，否则被黑方明车，红方就不能明车了。","text":"红方明车是要著，否则被黑方明车，红方就不能明车了。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":23,"anchor_node_id":"1:23","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_24","raw_text":"黑方平车去兵，次一著包九进四打兵，打算打烂红方的盘头马。","text":"黑方平车去兵，次一著包九进四打兵，打算打烂红方的盘头马。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"1:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_25","raw_text":"红方先进炮兑包。","text":"红方先进炮兑包。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"1:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_26:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_26","raw_text":"黑方平包去炮再架当头包。","text":"黑方平包去炮再架当头包。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":26,"anchor_node_id":"1:26","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_27:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_27","raw_text":"红方马五进四跃马弃马。","text":"红方马五进四跃马弃马。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":27,"anchor_node_id":"1:27","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_28","raw_text":"黑方这时候不能进车去马。","text":"黑方这时候不能进车去马。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"1:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_29","raw_text":"因为红方进马踩包。","text":"因为红方进马踩包。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"1:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_31:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_31","raw_text":"黑方飞象去马时。红方再进炮去象。","text":"黑方飞象去马时。红方再进炮去象。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":31,"anchor_node_id":"1:31","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_32","raw_text":"黑方只能够支士。","text":"黑方只能够支士。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"1:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_33","raw_text":"红方车八进八就成杀著了。","text":"红方车八进八就成杀著了。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"1:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_28:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_28","raw_text":"所以这个棋妙就妙在黑方居然不能进车去马。黑方马五进六反叫将，算是一步最强烈的反击。","text":"所以这个棋妙就妙在黑方居然不能进车去马。黑方马五进六反叫将，算是一步最强烈的反击。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":28,"anchor_node_id":"2:28","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_29","raw_text":"红方也不进马去炮，而冷静的士六进五是平凡的妙棋。","text":"红方也不进马去炮，而冷静的士六进五是平凡的妙棋。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"2:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_30","raw_text":"这一步黑方不能进车去马。","text":"这一步黑方不能进车去马。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"2:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_31:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_31","raw_text":"红方马四进二居然成杀著。","text":"红方马四进二居然成杀著。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":31,"anchor_node_id":"2:31","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_30:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_30","raw_text":"所以黑方要进马去炮。","text":"所以黑方要进马去炮。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":30,"anchor_node_id":"3:30","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_31:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_31","raw_text":"红方飞相去马。","text":"红方飞相去马。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":31,"anchor_node_id":"3:31","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_32","raw_text":"黑方进车去马。","text":"黑方进车去马。","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"3:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment3_33","raw_text":"局面到此红方略为优势，因为黑方一路车还在原地不动。||||这盘棋我们欣赏到红方夹马横车夹马盘头攻黑方三步虎的布局。本布局就介绍到这边，谢谢！","text":"局面到此红方略为优势，因为黑方一路车还在原地不动。\n\n这盘棋我们欣赏到红方夹马横车夹马盘头攻黑方三步虎的布局。本布局就介绍到这边，谢谢！","source_line_id":"3","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"3:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["十、当头炮横车夹马盘头攻屏风马平炮封车局"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第2节 进中兵攻击篇 第二章"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":54,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":4,"structured_branches":3,"line_statuses":{"legal":4},"source_move_records":55,"legal_move_records":55,"annotations":46,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":46}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-65","category_id":"65","title":"第二章 当头炮攻屏风马 第2节 进中兵攻击 十、当头炮横车夹马盘头攻屏风马平炮封车局","catalogue_order":51,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-65-3.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-65"]}}
